753	
754	They share exactly one number. **A later pass can replace module B entirely — a different painter, an
755	AI-rendered video surface, anything — without touching module A.** That is the seam BRIEF §4 asks for,
756	and it is one function boundary wide.
757	
758	The 3% dead-band stops a reader parked on a step boundary from strobing. `Math.floor(raw)` targets the
759	correct step directly rather than stepping by one, so a fast scroll or an anchor jump cannot lag.
760	
761	**Travel and step size.** At 1440×900 the scroll range is 1,771px; six steps is ~295px per step — far
762	above any strobe threshold.
