819	| State | α | composites on `#FAF8F5` | reading |
820	|---|---|---|---|
821	| dim | 0.06 | `#EEEDEB` | present, effectively invisible |
822	| fog | 0.18 | `#D6D5D3` | **fainter than the page's hairline `#C8C8C8`** — the fog sits behind the structure |
823	| near | 0.45 | `#8E8D8B` | the chain the reader just left |
824	| lit | 1.00 | `#1E1E1E` | the darkest mark on the page |
